      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-01-012\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1140]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>1</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>2</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>. PMS:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1141]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Incidence = 40%.</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1142]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Severe PMS = 5 \u2013 8%.</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1143]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Psychological Symptoms:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1144]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Depression, irritability, loss of interest, mood swings, loss of confidenc</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e \u2013 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>due to </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>serotonin + GABA receptors.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1145]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Physical symptoms:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1146]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bloatedness,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Mastalgia</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1147]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>More in luteal phase.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1148]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Etiology:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1149]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Two theories </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1150]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>w</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>omen </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>with</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> PMS progesterone levels are</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> same but </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>increased </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>sensitivity</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1151]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Neurotransmitters</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1152]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> serotonin receptors r sensitive to E &amp; P</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1153]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SSRI    e</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> symptoms.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1154]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GABA levels r modulated by Allopregnanolone (progesterone metabolite) in PMS allopregnanolone is    ed.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1155]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1156]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>symptoms diary over 2 months before starting treatment</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1157]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>if inconclusive =&gt;</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>trial of</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> GnRH Analogues A for 3 months for definitive diagnosis</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1158]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Referral:</strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1159]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Gynecologist:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1160]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>when simple measures failed</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1161]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>serve PMS requiring Gynecological intervention.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1162]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Psychiatrist: </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1163]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> non-cyclical symptoms, under lying psychotic or somatic disorder.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1164]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>MDT: Severe PMS</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1165]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gyn</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ecologists</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1166]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mental health professional</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1167]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> counselor psychologist</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1168]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dietitian</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1169]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GP</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1170]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1171]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>MANAGEMENT:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1172]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>1. complementary Therapies:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1173]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>T</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ried where hormonal treatment</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>C/I</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1174]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Mg+, Ca+</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> and </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>vit D</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>=&gt;</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> conflicting evidence</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1175]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>V</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>itex =&gt; Evidence available.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1176]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Primrose oil: improve </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Menstrual</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> symptoms and breast symptoms</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1177]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Calcium: improve physical and psychological symptoms</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1178]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vitex: Superior to placebo, pyridoxine and Mg++</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1179]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> don't recommend. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1180]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>2. CBT: </strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1181]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- routinely in severe PMS along with treatment</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1182]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- keep t/m effects maintained</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1183]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>3. Hormonal t/m</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1184]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Drosperinone containing pills</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1185]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Drosperinone = 3mg + Eth</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>i</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>nyl Estradiol = 20</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00b5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1186]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>YAZ</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: 3mg/30</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00b5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1187]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> - low dose OCP 24/</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1188]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Yasmin: 3mg/</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>0</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00b5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1189]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Percutaneous Estradiol:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1190]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Along with endometrial protection</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1191]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Implants unlicensed in UK for PMS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1192]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Contraception should be given with implants</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1193]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> where oral E is C/I</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>like Pts with RF for VTE</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1194]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Endometrial protection</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1195]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Norethisterone 2.5mg</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1196]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Micronized progesterone</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>,</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1197]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>O</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>ral</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> 100-200</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>\u00b5</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>g </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>(D17-D2</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>8 or</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> for 10-12days)</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>, act as diuretic also improve PMS symptoms.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1198]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>vaginal</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> avoid psychoactive metabol</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>ite</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> formation like </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Allopregnanolone (ALLO)</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>so </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>considered</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> first line.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1199]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>LNG</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u2013</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> ius</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>52m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> low levels of LNG can initially produce</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> PMS</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> type </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>side </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Effect</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> and bleeding problems</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1200]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>4.</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Danazol: </strong></em></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1201]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>low dose 200mg B.D</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> for Breast symptoms </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1202]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Androgenic</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> S/E </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1203]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>effective contraception while on danazol to avoid fetal effects</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1204]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>5.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>GnRH Analogues:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1205]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>highly effective 60-75%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1206]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not recommended routinely</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1207]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Given</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>severe PMS</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>or for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> diagnosis</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1208]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consider a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>dd-back Therapy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>if GnRH</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> A</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> given &gt; 6months</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>in the form of</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> CCT or Tibolone</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1209]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dexa scan </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>yearly in women with treatment on GnRH analogues.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1210]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>6.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-ser