, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Gradual withdrawal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>recommended</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1215]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>limited data on pregnancy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1216]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>cardiac defect reported so stop before pregnancy. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1217]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>7.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>SNRI</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1218]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>venlafaxine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> PMDD pre</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>menstrual</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> dysphoric disorder.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1219]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>8.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Spironolactone</