Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GnRH Analogues must be </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>tried as test of curse</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> before surgery. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1228]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HRT before </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>45yrs if TAH</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> + BSO done for PMS.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1229]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consider</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Testosterone after oophorectomy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1230]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Pre 1st line:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1231]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Exercise</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>CBT</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>B-6</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(offered to all)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1232]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>1st line: </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>=&gt; Mild symptoms</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1233]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>COC</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> or</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1234]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Low dose SSRI 10 \u2013 20mg</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1235]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Citalopram</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 luteal or continuous </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1236]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Escitalopram \u2013 luteal or continuous</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1237]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>2nd line: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1238]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Indications: </strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1239]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Failed 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>st</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> line</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1240]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Severe symptoms</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1241]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suicidal thoughts</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1242]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Work off</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> from work</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1243]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Family sufferings</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1244]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fx of VTE </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>even on mild symptoms</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1245]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Personal R.F for VTE</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1246]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Estradiol Patch 100</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00b5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g + oral/vaginal micronized progesterone 100-200mg</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1247]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>D 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>-28 or</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1248]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>LNG-IUS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1249]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>High dose SSRi 20-40mg., </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1250]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>continuous or luteal phase </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1251]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(not prescribe by gynecologist, if required Refer to Mental health professional).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1252]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>3rd line:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1253]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GnRH Analogous + Add-Back HRT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1254]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>CCT</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1255]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>50-100</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00b5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g E patch + micronized progestogen</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1256]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Or 2-4 doses of E Gel + micronized progestogen</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1257]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Tibolone</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1258]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2.5mg </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1259]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>4th line:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1260]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>TAH + BSO + HRT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1261]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MDT decides about surgery</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1262]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1263]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1264]\">\u00a0</p>",
